Do not overcrowd the screen or replace the current dashboard layout unnecessarily.

Where a workflow spans several steps, provide clear progress indicators and preserve relevant state when moving between steps.

Do not show a completed validation status merely because the user opened a page or uploaded a file.

6.2 OCR and document information extraction

Support OCR and extraction for relevant uploaded documents, including PDFs and image-based documents, according to the capabilities of the existing integrations.

The intended document types may include:

* Infrastructure proofs.
* No Objection Certificates.
